WEBVTT

01:41.920 --> 01:42.960
It's getting cold.

01:44.120 --> 01:45.280
The sooner we finish this,

01:46.360 --> 01:47.560
the sooner I can go to sleep.

02:08.240 --> 02:10.560
Greetings, Your Majesty.

02:22.640 --> 02:23.600
I…

02:27.680 --> 02:28.800
I want food.

02:33.600 --> 02:35.280
I haven't eaten in a long time.

02:44.320 --> 02:45.480
Don't go.

02:46.560 --> 02:47.480
Don't go.

02:49.960 --> 02:52.600
Don't go! Give me food.

02:52.680 --> 02:53.520
Don't go!

02:54.680 --> 02:55.800
Come back!

02:55.880 --> 02:58.080
Come back! Give me food!

02:58.160 --> 03:00.960
Give me food!

03:01.040 --> 03:02.040
Give me…

03:02.560 --> 03:04.360
Give me some warm food.

03:05.640 --> 03:08.600
Something warm. Something edible.

03:09.760 --> 03:11.840
Come back!

03:22.280 --> 03:23.280
How long have you starved him?

03:24.160 --> 03:25.000
He's a brat.

03:25.080 --> 03:27.160
I cooked and sent him food
in the beginning,

03:27.240 --> 03:29.240
but he asked for the golden milk pastry

03:29.320 --> 03:31.240
so I just ignored him.

03:32.080 --> 03:33.400
Now that I think about it,

03:33.920 --> 03:35.160
it's been two or three days.

03:35.920 --> 03:37.440
He won't starve to death anyway.

03:43.120 --> 03:44.080
Huai'an.

03:45.120 --> 03:46.960
You first treated him coldly

03:47.040 --> 03:49.040
before offering him a feast.

03:49.120 --> 03:51.640
Your way of treating an old acquaintance
is quite roundabout.

03:51.720 --> 03:53.800
We are not close.

03:54.320 --> 03:55.560
When I was 9 years old,

03:56.240 --> 03:57.560
we joined the Grand Academy together.

03:58.160 --> 03:59.360
He was the prince.

03:59.440 --> 04:01.960
But every time,
I was the one who got first place.

04:02.040 --> 04:03.440
Soon after,

04:03.520 --> 04:06.240
I found a small snake in my desk drawer.

04:06.800 --> 04:08.160
What do you think happened?

04:09.640 --> 04:11.720
He was the one who put the snake there.

04:11.800 --> 04:13.520
He thought I wouldn't discover the truth

04:14.520 --> 04:16.040
and even sent me the antidote.

04:16.959 --> 04:18.079
What a schemer.

04:18.760 --> 04:21.640
Once I was 10 years old,
I no longer saw him.

04:22.680 --> 04:24.600
Later, he became the emperor

04:25.280 --> 04:26.760
and lived under Yan Fengshan's thumb.

04:27.720 --> 04:30.760
I'm sure he has his own ways of survival.

04:32.080 --> 04:33.160
It's done.

04:36.520 --> 04:38.040
A fortunate fellow indeed.

04:38.560 --> 04:39.400
Where are you going?

04:41.000 --> 04:42.240
I'm taking food to that scoundrel.

04:46.480 --> 04:47.640
I made this meal for you.

04:48.360 --> 04:49.200
For me?

04:49.280 --> 04:51.360
You've been risking your life for me.

04:51.440 --> 04:53.760
Shouldn't I make a meal to thank you?

04:58.520 --> 04:59.720
Come and eat.

05:11.680 --> 05:13.720
Is this to be my final meal?

05:15.120 --> 05:15.960
Don't speak ill fortune.

05:16.720 --> 05:17.960
Even so, it's still worth it.

05:40.520 --> 05:43.240
Your life is hanging by a thread.

06:15.120 --> 06:17.640
The new emperor is looking for you.

06:18.320 --> 06:19.760
As long as you are still missing,

06:20.800 --> 06:22.360
his throne won't be secure.

06:23.840 --> 06:25.440
Yan Fengshan of the Huben Army

06:25.960 --> 06:28.040
means to use you to start a war.

06:29.200 --> 06:30.600
When that day comes,

06:31.240 --> 06:33.240
whether he wins or loses,

06:34.240 --> 06:36.040
you will still die.

06:37.840 --> 06:39.560
If you leave this place,

06:43.320 --> 06:44.920
the only fate waiting for you

06:47.240 --> 06:48.600
is death.

06:54.160 --> 06:55.320
You…

06:56.080 --> 06:57.520
you can save my life?

06:58.880 --> 07:00.120
Only I know of a way.

07:07.920 --> 07:10.200
What price must I pay?

07:12.120 --> 07:14.480
You are the bait I'm using
to deal with Yan Fengshan.

07:15.600 --> 07:17.080
I'm going to kill Yan Fengshan

07:17.960 --> 07:19.440
and wipe out the entire Huben Army.

07:20.040 --> 07:23.640
I need you to help me achieve that goal.

07:37.400 --> 07:38.320
Who are you?

07:44.800 --> 07:46.440
It's best that you don't recognize me.

07:47.560 --> 07:51.600
You should also forget the fact
that you are the emperor.

07:52.440 --> 07:53.680
I already knew

07:53.760 --> 07:55.920
what kind of person you were
back in the Grand Academy.

07:56.800 --> 07:59.640
I also know you have
your own way of staying alive.

08:02.600 --> 08:04.080
But from today onward,

08:05.080 --> 08:07.560
you will survive by the rules
I set for you.

08:08.280 --> 08:09.120
Otherwise,

08:13.520 --> 08:14.960
-you will die.
-You…

08:16.960 --> 08:17.960
Are you Liu…?

08:18.040 --> 08:19.960
That man is dead.

08:20.560 --> 08:24.280
I am your master now. I am Xie Huai'an.

08:29.560 --> 08:31.480
BEGINNING OF WINTER, WATER BEGINS
TO FREEZE, THE EARTH BEGINS TO HARDEN

08:31.560 --> 08:33.080
PHEASANTS ENTER THE WATER FOR CLAMS

08:58.520 --> 08:59.760
When I entered the city,

09:01.640 --> 09:03.040
I saw my younger sister.

09:05.200 --> 09:06.280
Has she been doing well?

09:11.080 --> 09:12.360
She's doing fine.

09:13.080 --> 09:14.760
Compared to 15 years ago,

09:16.120 --> 09:17.320
things here

09:19.840 --> 09:20.920
are much better.

09:22.840 --> 09:25.000
My master will be here tomorrow.

09:26.240 --> 09:30.280
Everything will proceed according to plan.

09:32.480 --> 09:33.360
All right.

09:34.160 --> 09:35.520
The vendetta of a gentleman

09:36.280 --> 09:37.640
leaves no man standing.

10:03.800 --> 10:07.440
When I received my first month's pay
as a registrar in Huainan,

10:08.040 --> 10:10.960
I hired an artist
to draw these six portraits.

10:11.040 --> 10:13.520
That was my seventh year on the run.

10:15.520 --> 10:17.960
I was afraid that I might forget
these people's faces.

10:19.360 --> 10:21.520
If I want to destroy the Huben Army,

10:21.600 --> 10:23.600
I must kill these six first.

10:25.040 --> 10:27.640
Pu Nichuan. In the 19th year of Qiansheng,

10:27.720 --> 10:30.080
he scouted for Yan Fengshan
and infiltrated Tiemo.

10:30.160 --> 10:33.000
When he was trapped,
he waited for help that never came.

10:33.080 --> 10:34.840
Yan Fengshan deemed him an abandoned pawn.

10:35.680 --> 10:38.840
Since then,
no one knows whether he's dead or alive.

10:42.600 --> 10:43.680
Father!

10:48.480 --> 10:50.320
I know very well
whether he's dead or alive.

11:03.080 --> 11:04.200
Wei Qianting.

11:05.320 --> 11:08.600
This man is elusive.
His whereabouts remain unknown.

11:17.160 --> 11:19.160
I met him seven years ago.

11:21.800 --> 11:23.520
But he should be

11:24.680 --> 11:27.440
buried in the reed swamps
of Nanwei Trough now.

11:30.440 --> 11:31.400
Yan Fengshan.

11:31.480 --> 11:34.400
He overthrew the emperor
and ruled the court for many years.

11:35.000 --> 11:37.560
People call him Emperor Yan.

11:41.200 --> 11:42.600
In the use of shadow guards,

11:43.120 --> 11:45.280
Yan Fengshan

11:45.360 --> 11:47.520
is way superior to my father.

11:53.160 --> 11:55.400
That is because he has
a particular man by his side.

11:57.360 --> 11:58.880
On the night my family was wiped out,

11:59.600 --> 12:03.080
he was there as well,
but I couldn't see his face clearly.

12:03.160 --> 12:05.000
LEGACY OF IMPERIAL FAVOR

12:05.640 --> 12:07.400
After so many years,

12:08.640 --> 12:10.560
I still haven't found any clues about him.

12:13.880 --> 12:16.240
Many within the Huben Army
are hiding in the shadows,

12:16.800 --> 12:20.120
but everyone knows these two people.

12:21.160 --> 12:24.240
Qingyi, who is in charge of surveillance
and intelligence.

12:24.320 --> 12:27.320
He possesses the secrets of many
important officials of the imperial court.

12:33.440 --> 12:34.480
Liu Ziyan.

12:36.800 --> 12:38.480
The best assassin of the Huben Army.

12:39.960 --> 12:41.280
He is in charge of killing.

12:42.800 --> 12:44.080
Whom shall we deal with first?

12:44.760 --> 12:46.920
My uncle, of course.

12:48.280 --> 12:50.240
I've wanted to kill him for so long.

12:53.880 --> 12:54.920
Aren't you the same?

12:55.000 --> 12:58.600
As long as he is still alive,
I can't live in peace.

12:59.640 --> 13:00.680
This day

13:01.640 --> 13:03.280
will come soon.

13:06.360 --> 13:10.160
YULONG RIDGE

13:50.880 --> 13:52.760
Are you here to bid me farewell?

13:55.360 --> 13:56.640
I'm afraid

13:59.760 --> 14:01.800
this is my last time serving you.

14:04.920 --> 14:07.400
Xiao Wuyang is not an easy target.

14:07.480 --> 14:09.360
If the Huben Army
wants to win against him…

14:09.440 --> 14:10.520
MYSTERIOUS PERSON

14:10.600 --> 14:12.600
…it won't be a swift victory.

14:13.680 --> 14:16.080
Why have you been mobilized at this time?

14:16.160 --> 14:18.280
My subordinate let someone escape.

14:18.360 --> 14:19.760
We hunted him through the city
for half a month,

14:19.840 --> 14:20.720
but found nothing.

14:21.880 --> 14:24.160
That man plays an important role
in the future.

14:25.120 --> 14:27.560
I must attend to it myself.

14:28.360 --> 14:30.120
This is interesting.

14:39.160 --> 14:40.800
It is a serious matter.

14:41.640 --> 14:42.560
Just go.

14:43.440 --> 14:44.800
The person

14:45.680 --> 14:48.200
serving you in the future
might not be as meticulous.

14:49.160 --> 14:50.600
Please be understanding.

14:51.240 --> 14:56.040
I've been imprisoned in Yulong Ridge
for more than a dozen years.

14:56.640 --> 14:59.360
I'm already dead inside.

15:00.400 --> 15:02.200
I'm not picky about my servants.

15:04.400 --> 15:05.440
Ziyan.

15:07.520 --> 15:09.240
One more thing.

15:09.840 --> 15:11.400
Liu Ziwen is your elder brother.

15:13.280 --> 15:16.040
Yan Fengshan wanted Liu Ziwen dead.

15:17.320 --> 15:19.880
Why did you do Yan Fengshan's bidding?

15:22.720 --> 15:24.480
There are many things

15:25.680 --> 15:27.800
my brother couldn't tolerate,

15:29.800 --> 15:31.680
but General Fengshan could.

15:34.360 --> 15:36.160
At the Battle of Chen Valley,

15:36.960 --> 15:38.480
I saved a civilian.

15:39.080 --> 15:41.520
His wife died early, leaving him
to care for parents and children.

15:42.120 --> 15:43.440
The whole family

15:44.200 --> 15:47.040
made a living through chopping bamboo
and weaving dustpans.

15:47.760 --> 15:51.080
When a war broke out,
they could no longer make a living.

15:51.680 --> 15:53.280
A five-year-old child

15:54.480 --> 15:56.160
sat on a wooden plate

15:56.800 --> 15:58.360
and ate the bamboo dustpan.

15:58.960 --> 16:00.560
The bamboo pricked
his torn mouth and lips.

16:02.040 --> 16:03.520
He was so pitiful.

16:05.640 --> 16:07.920
However, it's infuriating as well.

16:08.520 --> 16:10.960
Did that family betray you?

16:12.200 --> 16:14.200
I almost lost my life there.

16:15.080 --> 16:18.160
Under my brother's command,
some acts were forbidden.

16:18.760 --> 16:22.240
He said we killed people to save others.

16:22.840 --> 16:24.440
But since that day,

16:26.480 --> 16:27.880
I only kill others

16:29.440 --> 16:31.480
so no one can kill me.

16:38.720 --> 16:39.880
That sounds fair enough.

16:50.760 --> 16:51.880
Ziyan,

16:53.080 --> 16:54.120
farewell.

17:00.600 --> 17:02.240
WENYUAN EATERY, HUA'S MUTTON BROTH

17:02.320 --> 17:03.840
FENG'S CURED HAM SHOP

17:03.920 --> 17:05.359
WINE HOUSE

17:05.440 --> 17:06.440
How much are these vegetables?

17:06.520 --> 17:08.000
Take a look. They are fresh.

17:08.079 --> 17:10.000
Pick more and I'll give you a discount.

17:10.079 --> 17:13.560
-This is a little wilted.
-No, thanks.

17:13.640 --> 17:14.560
Look at something else.

17:25.920 --> 17:27.240
APOTHECARY

18:34.360 --> 18:35.960
You always go to extreme lengths.

18:37.000 --> 18:38.480
The capital is ruled by the emperor…

18:38.560 --> 18:39.480
STEADFAST AND UPRIGHT

18:39.560 --> 18:42.040
…yet you dare kill someone as you please.

18:43.080 --> 18:45.400
The enemies came and asked for your life.

18:45.920 --> 18:47.640
They even accused my men of harboring you.

18:48.960 --> 18:50.600
How much longer do you need

18:51.880 --> 18:54.320
to move on from the Chen Valley incident?

18:54.400 --> 18:56.840
It's not that I didn't move on,

18:56.920 --> 19:00.040
but I've chosen another path
after that night.

19:01.720 --> 19:03.320
You have a blade in your hand

19:04.800 --> 19:06.440
but you can't see things clearly.

19:08.880 --> 19:10.000
After today,

19:10.920 --> 19:12.080
you are no longer of the Huben Army.

19:13.680 --> 19:14.840
If you make another mistake,

19:16.080 --> 19:17.360
I will kill you myself.

19:22.640 --> 19:24.080
A military command is absolute.

19:25.920 --> 19:27.800
You'd better kill me today.

19:29.200 --> 19:30.840
Even if you spare me today,

19:32.680 --> 19:33.760
I might

19:35.920 --> 19:37.840
not spare you in the future.

19:47.520 --> 19:49.080
Our brotherhood

19:50.760 --> 19:51.880
ends

19:53.000 --> 19:54.400
now.

21:12.320 --> 21:14.440
My master bought this place.

21:14.520 --> 21:15.520
It is now private property.

21:16.240 --> 21:18.240
You must not go in, sir.

21:19.600 --> 21:21.360
I wanted to visit a familiar place.

21:21.880 --> 21:24.120
I didn't know
this place had another owner.

21:24.920 --> 21:25.920
Forgive me.

21:27.920 --> 21:30.040
Did you use to live here, sir?

21:31.840 --> 21:33.000
Yes.

21:33.080 --> 21:34.920
I was

21:35.760 --> 21:38.920
a superintendent of this residence.

21:45.000 --> 21:46.520
This courtyard

21:47.360 --> 21:48.880
must have been exquisite in the past.

21:51.200 --> 21:56.360
I wonder who once owned this residence.

21:57.360 --> 21:59.960
Two brothers lived here.

22:00.880 --> 22:05.040
The elder brother was the owner.
He was highly respected in Chang'an.

22:05.720 --> 22:06.720
The younger brother

22:07.680 --> 22:09.760
was more or less educated
and well-mannered.

22:09.840 --> 22:11.200
He always followed his elder brother.

22:11.800 --> 22:13.080
Look at this pear tree.

22:14.120 --> 22:15.160
When winter gave way to spring,

22:16.000 --> 22:17.920
it'd be full of pear blossoms.

22:18.000 --> 22:19.320
When the sun set,

22:19.400 --> 22:22.400
the courtyard would be bright
and full of guests.

22:22.920 --> 22:26.520
All the officials would be sitting there,
sipping tea and drinking wine.

22:26.600 --> 22:27.720
As for me,

22:27.800 --> 22:31.880
I would play
with my master's two children.

22:31.960 --> 22:33.080
It was so lively.

22:37.200 --> 22:40.400
So how has this residence
fallen into such decline?

22:50.880 --> 22:53.640
Young man, are you still

22:54.880 --> 22:56.600
in your twenties…

22:59.960 --> 23:02.160
Anyway, you are still young.

23:02.240 --> 23:07.000
In your life,
there are many things you cannot control.

23:07.640 --> 23:08.560
A couple of days ago,

23:08.640 --> 23:11.960
I suddenly remembered I had left something
in this residence.

23:12.760 --> 23:15.080
Can you do me a favor?

23:18.680 --> 23:20.000
Help yourself, then.

23:22.600 --> 23:23.760
Thank you.

23:49.360 --> 23:52.400
Uncle! My father is still breathing!

23:52.480 --> 23:53.680
Find a physician, quickly!

23:54.680 --> 23:55.760
Father!

24:07.360 --> 24:10.720
It seems like a blade.

24:12.920 --> 24:16.040
When I had hardships,
I dealt with them with this blade.

24:16.120 --> 24:17.520
Now, I'm having another hardship.

24:17.600 --> 24:19.640
So I'm retrieving it for good luck.

24:19.720 --> 24:20.680
A hardship?

24:21.200 --> 24:22.320
Like killing someone?

24:24.160 --> 24:25.520
Your guess

24:26.400 --> 24:27.600
is close enough.

24:53.480 --> 24:54.840
Behave now.

24:55.840 --> 24:57.760
Otherwise, you will die a cruel death.

25:15.800 --> 25:17.640
LAMB STEW WITH BREAD

25:32.160 --> 25:33.520
Enjoy your meal.

25:34.240 --> 25:35.760
Sir, please step inside.

25:42.080 --> 25:44.200
Sir, shared tables are not permitted.

25:44.720 --> 25:46.080
Why don't you sit inside?

25:46.160 --> 25:47.640
There are many empty seats.

25:48.360 --> 25:50.000
Hey, you.

25:50.080 --> 25:52.360
I'm talking to you. Did you not hear me?

26:00.440 --> 26:02.920
-Sir.
-How did you lose him?

26:03.520 --> 26:04.600
Before leaving Anfu Gate,

26:05.120 --> 26:06.400
at the palace steps,

26:06.480 --> 26:08.120
Someone in a black robe stopped me.

26:08.880 --> 26:10.160
He killed and wounded 17 of our men

26:10.680 --> 26:11.880
and took the deposed emperor away.

26:11.960 --> 26:12.920
Survivors say

26:13.520 --> 26:15.880
they wounded him in four places,
at least, with a blade.

26:15.960 --> 26:17.200
The blades were poisoned.

26:18.320 --> 26:19.840
Our men are posted
at all 12 gates of Chang'an.

26:20.720 --> 26:21.720
No one has sighted him.

26:22.320 --> 26:24.280
Chang'an might have a million families,

26:24.360 --> 26:28.480
but there aren't many places
that can harbor a martial arts expert.

26:28.560 --> 26:30.200
Besides, he is hurt

26:30.800 --> 26:32.520
and has an important person with him.

26:33.120 --> 26:36.320
Only a few physicians
can treat the poison on our army's blades.

26:37.160 --> 26:38.400
Keep investigating.

26:39.960 --> 26:40.960
Yes, sir.

26:56.040 --> 26:58.280
-Master.
-Mr. Long.

27:01.240 --> 27:05.080
ZHU ZHILONG

27:18.760 --> 27:21.120
Every time you send a letter,
you tell me how you

27:22.040 --> 27:24.680
endure hardships and wander in suffering.

27:26.120 --> 27:29.240
Looking at your physique,
it seems like you're doing well.

27:30.800 --> 27:33.160
Master, Huai'an has nine lives.

27:33.240 --> 27:34.080
He is very well.

27:34.160 --> 27:37.120
On the other hand, I, your disciple,
almost lost my life.

27:41.240 --> 27:42.720
If you died that easily,

27:43.240 --> 27:44.600
it means I've misjudged you

27:44.680 --> 27:46.360
and sent someone useless
to protect Huai'an.

27:46.440 --> 27:48.840
I'm fine. I'm your disciple after all.

27:54.800 --> 27:55.880
Is he the one?

28:08.240 --> 28:09.680
A fine choice for the puppet.

28:09.760 --> 28:12.040
Identical body size.

28:13.160 --> 28:14.200
Come in.

28:33.280 --> 28:34.480
You must wait a little longer.

28:47.400 --> 28:48.360
He…

28:50.200 --> 28:51.080
He is quite well.

28:52.520 --> 28:53.880
What illness does he have?

28:54.800 --> 28:55.640
He isn't ill.

28:55.720 --> 28:57.080
He just

28:57.160 --> 28:59.280
can't open his mouth
and ingest food or water.

28:59.360 --> 29:03.120
He is kept alive only
by drip-feeding the medicine I concocted.

29:04.680 --> 29:05.520
Why are you doing this?

29:05.600 --> 29:07.000
To raise a new skin

29:08.480 --> 29:10.200
for your appearance.

29:27.680 --> 29:29.360
The Huben Army is looking for you.

29:30.560 --> 29:31.800
From now on,

29:33.000 --> 29:35.360
you can never
show your real face to others.

29:36.080 --> 29:37.600
Otherwise, your life will be in danger

29:37.680 --> 29:39.280
wherever you are.

29:44.960 --> 29:46.280
You need to forget

29:47.320 --> 29:48.160
about yourself.

30:32.080 --> 30:32.920
It's his turn now.

30:33.000 --> 30:35.640
Ye Zheng, give him a Breath-holding Pill.

30:40.000 --> 30:41.400
No, I…

30:41.920 --> 30:42.840
Wait.

30:42.920 --> 30:44.560
-Open your mouth.
-Can you wait?

30:44.640 --> 30:45.800
Wait.

31:14.680 --> 31:16.200
This face suits him.

31:16.840 --> 31:19.760
So long as he stays silent,
no one will grow suspicious of him.

31:20.520 --> 31:22.800
Changing his face is just the first step.

31:23.320 --> 31:25.040
His movements and bearing

31:25.920 --> 31:27.520
must slowly change

31:28.120 --> 31:29.840
until every move of his

31:29.920 --> 31:32.600
resembles the other person
to complete the transformation.

31:34.640 --> 31:37.080
If the Huben Army knows
the deposed emperor is here,

31:37.160 --> 31:38.480
they will surely come here.

31:39.240 --> 31:40.280
In the end,

31:41.040 --> 31:42.800
Yan Fengshan will also appear.

31:43.440 --> 31:45.040
This is my final opportunity.

31:45.760 --> 31:47.440
Don't play with fire and burn yourself.

31:47.520 --> 31:50.200
The Huben Army might just assassinate you

31:50.280 --> 31:52.960
before you can successfully
lure out Yan Fengshan.

32:00.720 --> 32:02.160
I've steeled myself for death

32:03.800 --> 32:05.920
since the day I returned to Chang'an.

32:14.920 --> 32:15.880
Master.

32:16.520 --> 32:18.120
DEPOSED EMPEROR

32:18.200 --> 32:19.920
ZHANG MO

32:35.800 --> 32:38.000
SINGING-STRING TAVERN

33:01.600 --> 33:03.400
I've looked at a few residences
around here.

33:03.480 --> 33:04.680
This is the most suitable one.

33:05.600 --> 33:07.880
The gate in front can be guarded,
and there's a rear exit.

33:07.960 --> 33:10.800
More importantly,
there are fine restaurants around here.

33:12.040 --> 33:15.000
There's a market north of this place,
and the Tangshui Alley is not far.

33:16.480 --> 33:19.160
There's enough foot traffic here.
Being watched will not be a problem.

33:20.160 --> 33:21.360
The south of this place

33:21.440 --> 33:23.760
is next to the residents
of Chengqing Neighborhood.

33:24.280 --> 33:25.120
It's calm too.

33:25.840 --> 33:26.840
Wonderful.

33:27.360 --> 33:28.920
The patron is satisfied.

33:29.000 --> 33:31.040
What say you, Mo, the pageboy?

33:34.240 --> 33:35.600
Me?

33:36.120 --> 33:37.080
I think

33:37.880 --> 33:39.200
it's not bad.

33:45.440 --> 33:46.600
Your Majesty,

33:47.640 --> 33:49.720
you exposed yourself
with your reaction just now.

33:50.560 --> 33:53.440
Remember, you are now the pageboy, Mo.

34:01.320 --> 34:04.400
Your every movement and manner

34:05.120 --> 34:06.520
must match the other person.

35:01.400 --> 35:03.600
Your Majesty, you do look the part now.

35:04.880 --> 35:05.880
Like whom?

35:07.320 --> 35:08.200
Like a servant.

35:18.320 --> 35:19.520
I misspoke.

35:25.720 --> 35:26.720
It is all right.

35:27.600 --> 35:28.720
I am a servant.

35:34.080 --> 35:35.080
A prisoner.

35:37.360 --> 35:38.760
Xie and the rest

35:39.280 --> 35:41.200
are doing this for Your Majesty's
own good.

35:50.760 --> 35:51.920
No one in this world

35:53.600 --> 35:55.240
treats another well without reason.

35:56.400 --> 35:57.360
Xie Huai'an cares too much

35:58.040 --> 36:00.080
about his own interests in this.

36:04.120 --> 36:05.360
You mustn't tell him about this.

36:07.440 --> 36:09.320
Don't worry. I'm leaving tomorrow.

36:10.120 --> 36:12.360
You're leaving? Where for?

36:13.240 --> 36:15.360
Xie said you had made good progress.

36:15.440 --> 36:17.360
Therefore, I may go home now.
My home is in Huzhou.

36:20.840 --> 36:21.880
Huzhou

36:22.640 --> 36:23.760
is quite far.

36:26.080 --> 36:28.160
My wife gave birth
to a son and a daughter.

36:28.680 --> 36:29.600
We are a family of four.

36:32.920 --> 36:34.240
You are free now.

36:37.680 --> 36:39.000
I envy you.

36:59.200 --> 37:00.960
Young Master, may I come in?

37:01.800 --> 37:02.920
Come in.

37:15.960 --> 37:17.640
I've avoided a reunion with you

37:18.240 --> 37:19.760
because there were people around us.

37:20.560 --> 37:22.320
He is more observant than others.

37:22.400 --> 37:26.080
It's not a good thing
if he finds out about our past.

37:28.240 --> 37:29.480
I appreciate

37:30.560 --> 37:31.400
your concerns.

37:37.360 --> 37:40.680
On your 10th birthday,
I prepared a pair of shoes,

37:41.280 --> 37:43.680
wishing you a smooth road ahead.

37:45.680 --> 37:46.600
However…

37:48.480 --> 37:52.080
I was shocked to learn
that you were displaced for years.

37:59.640 --> 38:00.920
I am fortunate to meet you again.

38:01.760 --> 38:03.080
I've prepared another pair for you.

38:15.160 --> 38:16.200
Young Master.

38:34.200 --> 38:35.320
Zhang Mo,

38:38.440 --> 38:39.560
thank you.

38:50.480 --> 38:51.560
Please let me

38:52.520 --> 38:54.120
put them on for you.

38:59.640 --> 39:02.360
I… I was your pageboy.

39:11.120 --> 39:12.120
Please allow me

39:13.520 --> 39:14.640
to serve you

39:16.240 --> 39:17.480
one last time.

39:55.080 --> 39:56.560
This path you've chosen

39:58.720 --> 39:59.880
will be full of hardships.

40:02.880 --> 40:03.920
Forgive me

40:08.560 --> 40:10.000
for not being able to accompany you

40:12.120 --> 40:13.280
along the way.

40:23.160 --> 40:24.200
Mo,

40:26.320 --> 40:27.600
your life

40:28.760 --> 40:30.520
should be your own.

40:33.840 --> 40:35.040
Go back to Huzhou.

40:36.720 --> 40:37.920
Your family

40:38.840 --> 40:40.080
is waiting for you.

40:41.800 --> 40:43.920
If I'm lucky enough to return alive,

40:44.440 --> 40:46.320
remember to prepare a jar
of good wine for me

40:50.560 --> 40:52.560
when I pass by Huzhou.

41:10.200 --> 41:11.400
From now on,

41:12.160 --> 41:13.920
you cannot show your real face to others.

41:15.440 --> 41:18.520
You need to forget about yourself.

41:20.040 --> 41:21.480
You are now the pageboy, Mo.

41:22.840 --> 41:24.040
Your Majesty,

41:24.560 --> 41:26.760
you do look like it now. Like a servant.

41:26.840 --> 41:29.560
I also know you have
your own way of surviving.

41:30.160 --> 41:31.400
But from today onward,

41:31.480 --> 41:34.240
you must survive
with the rules I set for you.

41:34.960 --> 41:37.920
Otherwise, you will die.

41:38.000 --> 41:40.120
Give me something to eat. I'm hungry.

41:40.200 --> 41:41.920
Something edible.

41:42.880 --> 41:44.080
I may go home now.

41:44.160 --> 41:46.480
My wife gave birth to a son
and a daughter.

41:46.560 --> 41:48.040
We are a family of four.

41:52.280 --> 41:54.040
You are free now.

41:58.920 --> 42:01.280
Your Majesty, farewell.

42:02.840 --> 42:04.480
Please be cautious henceforth,
Your Majesty.

42:05.000 --> 42:06.160
Xie is a kind man.

42:06.240 --> 42:08.600
I'm sure he will
find you a good place to stay.

42:13.160 --> 42:14.000
Safe travels.

42:48.120 --> 42:49.280
Mo!

43:03.800 --> 43:06.160
Didn't you want me to be exactly like him?

43:08.200 --> 43:09.880
Take a guess.

43:11.320 --> 43:12.640
Who is the one

43:14.400 --> 43:15.440
lying there now?

43:19.680 --> 43:20.680
Who is it?

43:34.880 --> 43:36.200
You deserve death.

43:38.680 --> 43:40.360
You truly deserve to die.

44:00.080 --> 44:01.240
Mother.

44:01.320 --> 44:04.160
Why did you prepare so much food?

44:04.240 --> 44:07.200
-Because Father is coming back.
-Really?

44:07.760 --> 44:10.480
Yes.
Father will soon return from Chang'an.

44:11.640 --> 44:13.560
Father is coming back!

44:14.080 --> 44:15.720
Father is coming back!
